- On the online ISO, add the NVIDIA Tumbleweed repository for the
  Agama solve only, aliased agama-nvidia at priority 200. Agama
  removes that alias afterwards, so an AMD install does not keep
  the URL. Selecting the NVIDIA pattern installs the open G07
  driver during the solve. atropos-nvidia keeps the same URL at
  priority 200 when that pattern is selected.

